8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"penalty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"possible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"report_channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"online_register\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"report_status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"active_under_review\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shared_capabilities\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"risk_assessment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"grievance_mechanism\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"effectiveness_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>把 <code>shared_capabilities</code> 单独列出来是这张矩阵的实用价值所在</strong>：它告诉组织哪些能力是三个法域共用的、值得投入建设，哪些只是各自的形式差异、可以靠模板裁剪解决。第三章的追溯链与红旗信号属于前者；声明的章节结构与提交渠道属于后者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>报告式立法只要求披露，不禁止进口；合规产出是公开声明而非放行。</li>\n<li>德国 LkSG 是特例：它有实质尽责义务与罚款，门槛 3,000→1,000 员工，但 2025 年法案提议取消报告义务与大部分罚则。</li>\n<li>英国第 54 条门槛 £36m 营业额，无处罚，靠官方与民间登记处形成声誉压力。</li>\n<li>澳大利亚门槛 A$100m 合并营收，七项强制准则，登记强制，2023 年审查指向可能强化。</li>\n<li>正确组织方式是一套尽责体系支撑多份法域声明，把共用能力与形式差异分开管理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"德国 LkSG 与英澳现代奴役法矩阵","id":"德国-lksg-与英澳现代奴役法矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：报告式立法的共同结构","id":"核心概念-报告式立法的共同结构"},{"level":2,"text":"德国 LkSG 的实施细节","id":"德国-lksg-的实施细节"},{"level":3,"text":"六项尽责义务","id":"六项尽责义务"},{"level":3,"text":"2025 年的重要变化","id":"2025-年的重要变化"},{"level":2,"text":"英国现代奴役法第 54 条","id":"英国现代奴役法第-54-条"},{"level":3,"text":"声明的内容与形式要求","id":"声明的内容与形式要求"},{"level":3,"text":"无处罚的执行缺口与声誉替代机制","id":"无处罚的执行缺口与声誉替代机制"},{"level":2,"text":"澳大利亚现代奴役法 2018","id":"澳大利亚现代奴役法-2018"},{"level":2,"text":"如何组织统一矩阵","id":"如何组织统一矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"欧盟强迫劳动产品禁令与 CSDDD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supply-chain-social-due-diligence-forced-labor/forced-labor-regulation/eu-forced-labor-ban-csddd"},"next":{"title":"供应商分层与高风险品类地区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supply-chain-social-due-diligence-forced-labor/supplier-social-due-diligence/supplier-tier-risk-segmentation"}}